NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY CONTENT

This license covers the tooling (`tools/*.py`, `*.cmd`) and the documentation
(`docs/*.md`, `README.md`, `SANITIZE.md`) in this repository.

`output/recovered_tscan/` contains material extracted from a third-party
binary (TscanPlus, https://github.com/TideSec/TscanPlus): embedded resources,
decrypted POC templates, fingerprint data, and reconstructed Go declarations.
Copyright in that material remains with its original authors. It is included
here as a research/format-analysis archive only, without any license grant,
and must not be redistributed as a product or used commercially on its own.
The binary itself is NOT included in this repository.
